//! Level 2: the Solana Trenches. Not a battlefield: the memecoin casino of Crypto
//! Twitter, where a coin launches every minute and most of them rug. A neon Vegas strip,
//! the casino's gaming floor, then an elevator up to the exchange suites and SAM's
//! trading floor. The casino pays in gold coins, not diamonds; the penguin cashier
//! changes them after the fight. See `level.rs` for the map legend.
//!
//! Columns: the street 0-71, the casino floor 72-183, a sealed wall, the upper floors
//! 186-281 and the arena 282-311.

use crate::{
    level::{BossKind, Level, Theme},
    talk::{Line, Speaker},
};

